%description:
Tests the AccECN fallback of a retransmitted SYN (RFC 9768 section 3.1.4.1).
The tester removes the SYN and its first retransmission, which both request
AccECN with (AE,CWR,ECE) = (1,1,1). The client "SHOULD send subsequent
retransmissions of the SYN with the three TCP-ECN flags cleared", so A003 has
no ECN flags, and the connection uses no ECN.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="12.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.tcptester.script="a1 delete; a2 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[3.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[9.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[9.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 2250500:2250500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[9.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 2250501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[12.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 2250501 win 16384 
[12.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
